Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:02:07.19,0:02:10.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Rubber. It doesn't conduct electricity!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:10.56,0:02:15.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And so that means, Eneru can't\Nhurt a rubber person!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:16.10,0:02:22.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go Luffy! Stop him.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.12,0:02:38.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You! You're no mere mortal!\NWhat are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:38.88,0:02:44.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Me? I'm Luffy.\NA pirate, and a rubber man.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:45.44,0:02:46.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What? Rubber?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:48.15,0:02:50.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I see. Rubber doesn't exist in Skypiea.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:50.10,0:02:51.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He doesn't know what it is.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.82,0:02:54.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That lightning of yours...\Nwon't work on me!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.78,0:02:55.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Mantra.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.41,0:03:03.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum... Whip!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:26.27,0:03:27.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.19,0:03:35.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't push your luck.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.23,0:03:40.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lightning can cause far more\Nthan just electric shocks.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.91,0:03:43.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I don't have to tell\Nyou that, "rubber man."
Dialogue: 50,0:03:43.99,0:03:45.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You found out the hard way!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.66,0:03:50.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're gonna\Nhave to do better than that!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.88,0:03:55.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.92,0:03:58.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's got that weird ability\Nto predict my moves. Dammit!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.89,0:04:02.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just what is this "rubber"?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.98,0:04:06.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, hold on. This "rubber man".
Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.94,0:04:11.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's a paramecia.\NEven they have weaknesses.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:11.03,0:04:14.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gloam... Paddling!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:16.41,0:04:18.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.08,0:04:21.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm on a bit of a schedule,\Nso I don't have time to play.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.87,0:04:25.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He! He's changing\Nhis staff into a blade!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.38,0:04:32.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Think of it as lightning in solid form!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.60,0:04:40.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As I thought, slashing\Nattacks are your weakness!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.93,0:04:41.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:41.81,0:04:45.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't tell him that!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.34,0:04:48.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum Gatling!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:50.67,0:04:51.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.86,0:04:54.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Behind you!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.11,0:05:01.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He can move right through... the gold?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:27.77,0:05:29.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You may be\Nimmune to lightning,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.77,0:05:31.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but not to electric heat it seems!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:33.55,0:05:36.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum...!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:36.65,0:05:39.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...Battle Axe!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.54,0:05:51.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You blasphemous brat!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.34,0:05:57.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}All right! Gum-Gum... Gatling!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.85,0:06:09.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's not as though\Nyou grew more arms, Idiot!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.48,0:06:14.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.52,0:06:17.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sightseeing on sky island. Hmph.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:17.99,0:06:22.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You Blue Sea people certainly\Npicked a bad time to visit.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:23.15,0:06:28.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am this land's god. I can\Ndo anything my will desires.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.40,0:06:32.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've long dreamed of\Ncreating an ideal world!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.33,0:06:37.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}This dream will become a reality,\Nand I won't let anyone stand in my way!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.04,0:06:41.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Least of all some whelp\Nfrom the Blue Sea world!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.88,0:06:45.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, where were we?\NAh, yes. How could I forget?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:45.84,0:06:48.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We were going to watch this land die.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.81,0:06:54.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! You can't!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.44,0:06:59.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Max. Two hundred million volt Vari!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.03,0:07:17.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Horsey-Bird! What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.38,0:07:23.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's moving!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.55,0:07:27.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Nami!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.79,0:07:33.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Behold! Maxim!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:33.46,0:07:36.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The ark that will take\Nme to Endless Vearth!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.13,0:07:42.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To the sacred land without end\Nthat I desire! Rise Maxim! Rise!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.32,0:07:51.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's... flying!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.73,0:08:00.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Oh, no! Oh, no!\NOh, no! Oh, no! Oh, no! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:00.19,0:08:01.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.86,0:08:04.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Hurry up and stop Eneru!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.49,0:08:06.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But, wait a minute!\NThis ark's powered by Eneru,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:06.82,0:08:09.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so if he's defeated,\Nit'll crash with us on it!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.20,0:08:11.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But if he's not, the sky islands\Ngoing to be destroyed!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:11.74,0:08:15.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}And if we stay here and do nothing, we'll\Nbe taken to some land far away with Eneru!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.54,0:08:16.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't like our options!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:16.79,0:08:18.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, we still lose!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.96,0:08:23.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do, Luffy?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.76,0:08:25.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm really scared!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:33.35,0:08:34.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.77,0:08:37.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't be. Just calm down.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.38,0:08:40.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Calm down? But how?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.30,0:08:44.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You sail with the crew of the\Nfuture King of the Pirates.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.84,0:08:48.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So wipe that frown off, all right?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:53.27,0:08:57.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,King of the Pirates? And what\Ndomain does he lord over?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.90,0:09:06.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's the king of the seas!\NThe greatest king of all!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:09.41,0:09:11.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hpmh! So you say.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.79,0:09:15.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But we'll soon learn if\Nthat's true. Won't we?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:42.12,0:09:46.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Here, look! The ship! It's stopped!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.09,0:09:48.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's stuck in the Vearth!\NIt can't go any higher!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.71,0:09:50.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But look! It's scraping away!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.88,0:09:53.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time\Nbefore it breaks through!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.22,0:09:57.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, we can't. We'll get in his way!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.68,0:10:00.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He may be from the Blue Sea world,\Nbut Luffy's still a warrior!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.93,0:10:02.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A warrior's duel is sacred!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:02.85,0:10:04.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You should never interfere in it!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.75,0:10:10.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The circuit to\Nthis ark's ultimate function
Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.38,0:10:14.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,has been initiated and is now\Nrunning at full capacity!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.14,0:10:17.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It has a name. It's called Deathpiea.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:17.56,0:10:20.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The despair that will\Ndestroy this world.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:48.86,0:10:50.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chief! Come quick!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.51,0:10:53.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Something's happening in\Nthe sky over Upperyard!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.03,0:10:55.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.66,0:10:58.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It. It just suddenly got dark!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.29,0:11:01.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've never seen the skies over\Nthis island look like that.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.96,0:11:04.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Strange. What could it be?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.42,0:11:07.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you think something bad\Nhappened to Wyper and the warriors?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.59,0:11:14.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I hope not, but I, too, have never\Nseen such dark clouds in the sky of the
Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.14,0:11:15.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,White-White Sea.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.49,0:11:21.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Using my energy, Deathpiea\Nforces extremely turbulent air
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.75,0:11:24.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,currents together, which produce\Nthose lovely thunderclouds
Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.71,0:11:26.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you see billowing out right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.83,0:11:28.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thunderclouds?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.38,0:11:31.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Soon they will envelop\Nall of Skypiea in darkness.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.63,0:11:36.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Inside them, energy will continue to build\Nuntil it's reached its absolute peak.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.55,0:11:40.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And then, on my signal,\Nthey will unleash thunderbolts
Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.01,0:11:44.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of such magnitude that every trace\Nof this land will be obliterated!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.73,0:11:48.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Allow me to demonstrate.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.41,0:12:03.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That came from Upperyard!\NGet to the ships!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.95,0:12:06.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everyone, keep calm! Don't panic!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.33,0:12:08.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get on a ship and head for Cloud End!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.93,0:12:14.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.61,0:12:24.49,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Eneru!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.44,0:12:35.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You... just...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.91,0:12:38.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just teased the angels a little.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.38,0:12:40.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But after all, that is my right.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.10,0:12:43.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So being a god makes it\Nokay to destroy everything?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.56,0:12:47.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course. Everything here\Nis mine for the taking.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.40,0:12:50.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Their land. Their lives.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.36,0:12:51.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:51.36,0:12:53.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll continue celebrating\Nby taking yours!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.20,0:13:03.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow! Hot! Hot!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:03.59,0:13:07.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This spear has\Nbeen highly charged!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.09,0:13:26.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.11,0:13:32.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How. How can I defeat a guy,\Nwho can predict my moves?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.80,0:13:35.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:36.63,0:13:40.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:40.01,0:13:40.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...Daze...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.84,0:13:44.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.80,0:13:59.75,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}He's dodging the attacks unconsciously\Nand just relying on his reflexes!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:59.75,0:14:01.94,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,It's almost like he's a\Nblade of grass that sways
Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.94,0:14:04.36,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,back and forth in the wind\Ninstead of opposing it!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.67,0:14:08.42,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,He's not thinking! That's why\NEneru can't predict his moves!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.37,0:14:10.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.24,0:14:20.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But if I switch my brain off...\NThen I can't attack him!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.62,0:14:22.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't stop now!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.00,0:14:24.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I gotta get my hands on\Nhim somehow. Come on! Think!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.50,0:14:26.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be a way.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:26.60,0:14:28.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:31.64,0:14:35.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum... Octopus!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.67,0:14:39.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Enough with the stupid ideas!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.80,0:14:44.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I take it you're no\Nfan of my Mantra, are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.39,0:14:48.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's to be expected, since it\Nis the basis of my power!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.93,0:14:51.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That place should work!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.08,0:14:54.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:54.46,0:14:56.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter what you try.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:42.95,0:15:46.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course!\NThe punches are ricocheting.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.54,0:15:48.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's not consciously controlling them!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.26,0:15:51.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not letting you get away again!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.96,0:15:55.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.34,0:15:56.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.59,0:15:59.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...Bazooka!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:15.90,0:16:21.28,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,No! He's charging!\NI... I have to escape!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.46,0:16:25.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.20,0:16:26.70,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,He can't!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:28.79,0:16:32.50,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I... I'm a god!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:32.50,0:16:33.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...Rifle!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:03.03,0:17:06.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! The ships leaving the Vearth!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.12,0:17:13.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?\NIt's gonna fly away!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.96,0:17:17.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It worked! You did it!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:18.07,0:17:19.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But... wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.42,0:17:22.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The ship's taking off!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.77,0:17:27.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, no way. He's getting back up!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:27.19,0:17:31.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You fools! Is that the best you can do?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.62,0:17:38.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Make no mistake, boy!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.62,0:17:41.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When you're gone,\Nthe world will be mine!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:45.12,0:17:51.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And once again, everyone will fear\Nme, worship me, and revere me!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.30,0:17:54.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am all-powerful!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:54.22,0:17:59.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In this world, filth like you\Nmust learn the only truth.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:59.46,0:18:05.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,By my hand, nothing is ever impossible!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.11,0:18:12.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For I am the Almighty God!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:14.78,0:18:16.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.52,0:18:20.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Up in the sky, something\Nfloating over Upper Yard!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:20.75,0:18:22.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a... ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.77,0:18:25.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A flying ship? Impossible!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.19,0:18:27.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of such a thing!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.51,0:18:36.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's what made the sky turn dark?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.35,0:18:38.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,God is on that ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.44,0:18:44.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! You gotta get outta here!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:44.74,0:18:47.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Board the ships!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:51.36,0:18:54.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vessels are leaving Angel\NIsland by the hundreds!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.13,0:19:01.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What evil is this? Those dark\Nclouds are an ominous sign.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.87,0:19:04.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look! Someone is coming this way!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:05.13,0:19:07.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shandorians!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.34,0:19:10.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take heed! Ready your\Nships and evacuate!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:10.76,0:19:13.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The sky islands are doomed!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.51,0:19:14.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're what?!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.56,0:19:16.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have to escape!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.39,0:19:17.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To the Sea!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:17.34,0:19:20.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not... the Blue Sea?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.47,0:19:39.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look hard, rubber boy.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:39.51,0:19:42.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,On a falling island's despair.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.90,0:19:52.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Skypeia will be destroyed,\Nthe angels' lives extinguished.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:52.75,0:19:54.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No one can stop me. Heh.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:55.35,0:19:56.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not even you!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.16,0:19:59.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wanna bet?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:59.95,0:20:01.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gloam...!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:02.06,0:20:03.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The golden wall!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:03.25,0:20:05.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No you don't!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:05.18,0:20:06.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...Paddling!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.52,0:20:07.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! Hot! Hot! Hot!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:07.77,0:20:10.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He melted it like butter!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.36,0:20:15.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yowtch! It burns! It burns! It burns!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.99,0:20:17.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:18.28,0:20:21.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It won't come off!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.41,0:20:23.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, rubber man?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:23.49,0:20:26.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you like the way\NI've evened the odds?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.12,0:20:28.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've simply taken the fight out of you.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.07,0:20:30.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get this off of me!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:31.67,0:20:36.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You see, I'm honestly not sure I\Ncould take another hit from you.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:37.60,0:20:43.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Therefore... I think it\Nbest if we sever ties.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.11,0:20:46.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But in honor of the spirited\Neffort you've put forth,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:46.44,0:20:49.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,take this gold bauble\Nas a parting gift!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:09.71,0:21:10.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.35,0:21:16.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Once I'm finally rid of you,\Nthis world will be mine again!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:18.56,0:21:20.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just as it was before.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:20.82,0:21:24.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And not a soul in the\Nworld can defeat me!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:24.68,0:21:26.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not a soul in the world?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.45,0:21:28.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.45,0:21:33.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're an idiot! Even if\NI can't defeat you,
Dialogue: 50,0:21:33.05,0:21:38.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}back in the Blue Sea, there are tons more\Nfighters who can put you in your place!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:38.34,0:21:40.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Someone like you could never...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:42.10,0:21:44.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You talk too much, boy.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.06,0:21:49.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now fall!\NFall along with the sky island!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:49.65,0:21:51.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You won't win!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:52.50,0:21:53.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:55.13,0:21:57.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:04.26,0:22:05.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:05.56,0:22:07.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eneru!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:08.89,0:22:13.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Horsey-Bird, look!\NThat's Luffy! He's falling!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:16.48,0:22:19.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh no. Aisa and Pierre!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:19.91,0:22:21.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Aisa.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:21.53,0:22:25.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So that sly, little voice I've\Nbeen hearing has a name.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:25.62,0:22:29.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fight me, you coward!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:31.54,0:22:33.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy! We're coming to save you!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:34.88,0:22:38.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I tire of this. Time to die!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:38.72,0:22:42.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aisa! Pierre! He's gonna shoot you!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:42.22,0:22:44.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eneru!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:47.02,0:22:49.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}God's Judgment!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:50.06,0:22:51.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}El... Thor!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:04.24,0:23:06.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:07.49,0:23:11.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aisa! Pierre!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:12.44,0:23:15.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For all my strength, he hurt me.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:16.10,0:23:20.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yet, here I stand, the victor.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:29.74,0:23:31.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's enormous.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:32.43,0:23:35.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, this is the ark the Divine\NSquad was forced to build.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:40.98,0:23:43.32,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Right here. On the\Nnortheastern edge of the island.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:44.50,0:23:48.26,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,After the others get the gold, this is\Nwhere we're all supposed to meet up.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:48.26,0:23:52.33,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}And once all of you are together again,\Nyou're planning to escape, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:52.33,0:23:54.16,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,As long as we have the treasure!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:54.16,0:23:57.41,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not going anywhere without it! Heh!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:58.12,0:24:00.27,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:00.27,0:24:04.65,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}They're heading northeast toward the seashore.\NNo doubt returning to their ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:04.65,0:24:08.82,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,The smartest thing right now is go on\Nahead and wait for them to show up.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:08.82,0:24:12.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Afterall, they'll need me to\Nguide them back to the Blue Sea!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:12.24,0:24:14.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm their best chance\Nto escape the island!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:17.48,0:24:19.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I have to get to\Nthe Going Merry, and fast!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:22.82,0:24:24.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:24.20,0:24:27.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You smell nice.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:29.04,0:24:31.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! It's not fair!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:31.00,0:24:34.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One minute I'm dreaming,\Nthe next I'm in a nightmare!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:34.25,0:24:36.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait. Hold on.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:36.25,0:24:37.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:41.29,0:24:44.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What... What is that?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:50.97,0:24:52.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:53.21,0:24:55.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She's in trouble!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:58.17,0:25:00.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Usopp! Wake up!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:00.26,0:25:03.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is no time to be\Nin bed, you idiot!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:03.60,0:25:07.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is it? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:07.86,0:25:09.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Never mind that. Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:09.95,0:25:12.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? Go where?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:12.57,0:25:14.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where d'you think? To rescue Nami.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:15.06,0:25:18.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Rescue, huh? Um...
Dialogue: 50,0:25:18.59,0:25:20.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, it's all\Ncomin' back to me!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:20.79,0:25:22.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I-I remember everything!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:34.50,0:25:37.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No. God came!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:37.29,0:25:38.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}– Oh, nice, I angered a God!\N– Would you relax?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:38.96,0:25:40.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's long gone by now.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:40.59,0:25:42.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}...how can I get myself smotted?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:42.35,0:25:43.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's Nami who's in trouble!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:43.64,0:25:45.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}She's the one who got kidnapped!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:45.98,0:25:47.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:47.29,0:25:49.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How could we have been so stupid?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:49.96,0:25:54.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is all our fault!\NShe's too cute for this!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:54.01,0:25:59.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay, so he took her... But where to?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:01.92,0:26:02.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:03.10,0:26:04.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:06.56,0:26:10.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's big! Big ship! Flying!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:10.47,0:26:16.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Though I only saw her for a second,\NI'm sure it was Nami on that ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:16.05,0:26:20.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And while I may not know\Nwhat dangers lie ahead,
Dialogue: 50,0:26:20.25,0:26:22.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,at least she's not wearing\Nthat t-shirt anymore!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:22.50,0:26:25.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Again with the t-shirt? Focus!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:25.75,0:26:28.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm missing something here.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:28.17,0:26:31.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where're Conis, Weird Knight\Nand the others?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:31.54,0:26:34.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know. But we have to hurry.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:43.65,0:26:46.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji! Where ya going?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:46.02,0:26:48.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To that ship! Where else?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:48.10,0:26:49.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Say what?!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:49.89,0:26:53.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Run faster or we'll lose'em!\NMy love needs us!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:53.83,0:26:57.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so um, if I'm following you,\Ndoes that mean I'm going too?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:57.73,0:27:00.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course! I need\Nyour help to get on board!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:00.02,0:27:01.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You still have that rope you\Nshoot outta your belly?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:01.90,0:27:04.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My "Usopp Ahh-ahh-ahh"? Oh sure!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:04.69,0:27:06.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll let you use it\Nwhile I wait down here!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:06.57,0:27:08.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just hurry up, ya coward!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:08.32,0:27:10.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, wait! You don't need me!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:10.73,0:27:12.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The air's too thin up there!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:12.36,0:27:16.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm coming for you,\NNami, my beautiful swan!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:20.69,0:27:23.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now that the Ark Maxim is activated,
Dialogue: 50,0:27:25.49,0:27:29.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,nothing can save this nation\Nfrom its inevitable destruction.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:30.76,0:27:34.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? You're lucky\Nto have made it this far.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:34.47,0:27:36.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Abandon all thoughts of your\Nincompetent playmates
Dialogue: 50,0:27:36.93,0:27:41.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and embrace the glorious\Nfuture I've given you.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:41.10,0:27:44.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks. You're a swell guy.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:44.16,0:27:46.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But one thing's more\Nprecious than gold.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:49.19,0:27:51.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a treasure called friendship.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:54.32,0:27:57.58,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,We're gonna to get some gold!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:59.75,0:28:00.83,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I treasure!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:00.83,0:28:02.83,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:07.09,0:28:12.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What good is owning the world's\Nwealth without friends to share it?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:12.55,0:28:14.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This island is filled with riches
Dialogue: 50,0:28:14.34,0:28:18.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd love to get my hands on.\NBut sacrificing my friends
Dialogue: 50,0:28:18.07,0:28:21.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and enduring your ego\Nis too steep a price to pay.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:21.40,0:28:23.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, your treasure?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:24.43,0:28:29.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's yours. I don't want it!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:29.10,0:28:32.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Really? You don't want anything?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:39.07,0:28:41.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not even... your life?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:44.49,0:28:47.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Suu. Tell me what happened?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:51.12,0:28:54.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But, wait! Neither Sanji\Nnor Usopp are in any shape
Dialogue: 50,0:28:54.08,0:28:56.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to be moving around!\NWhy aren't they here?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:59.05,0:29:01.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where did they go?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:01.51,0:29:03.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on, tell me!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:09.91,0:29:12.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Sanji woke up and\Nthen he woke up Usopp.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:12.10,0:29:16.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}And they both ran and jumped up?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:16.27,0:29:19.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To the... the ship? You're sure?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:22.03,0:29:23.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But they're not fully healed!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:23.88,0:29:27.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, look at this place. It's a mess.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:47.62,0:29:54.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp Aa-aa-ahh!\NUsopp Aa-aa-ahh! Come on!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:56.17,0:30:01.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,God of the White Sea or not,\Nif he lays a finger on Nami,
Dialogue: 50,0:30:01.84,0:30:05.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll be his personal\NBlue Sea nightmare!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:06.91,0:30:10.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami swan!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:17.02,0:30:21.36,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy. I need to borrow\Nsome of your courage!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=3}===============================DIALOGUE============================
